# Flutter UI

- Material 3 + `AppTheme.lightTheme`. Colors from `AppColors` (primary `#4A90E2`). No one-off hex.
- Reuse `AppButton`, `AppDialog`, `AppToast`, `AppCard`.
- Screens: `ConsumerWidget` / `ConsumerStatefulWidget`. Do not construct `ApiService` in `build`.
- Routes live in `lib/main.dart`. Update `redirect` when adding paths.
- User-visible strings: `AppLocalizations.of(context)!` + both ARB files.
- Errors: `ApiError.userMessage` / `utils/error_display.dart`.
- Destructive actions: `AppDialog.showConfirm(..., isDanger: true)`.
